
══════════════════════════════════════════════
  EML Stats : Pairwise Wilcoxon/Mann-Whitney (Bonferroni adjustment)
══════════════════════════════════════════════

  Table               fixture_kgroups
  Data column         F0_Hz
  Group column        voice_type
  Groups              3
  Pairs tested        3
  p adjustment        Bonferroni
  Alpha               0.05
  Group order: table order (Alto, Mezzo, Soprano).


  ── Group descriptives ──────────────────────

  Group               n      Mean         SD
  Alto                8      214.8750     12.0337
  Mezzo               8      221.2000     11.4163
  Soprano             8      227.7125     12.0987


  ── Per-pair results ────────────────────────
  Why: Compares distributions of two independent groups without assuming normality.

  Comparison                U                   p (raw)    p (adj)    r
  Alto vs Mezzo             23.00               .382       1.000      -0.281
  Alto vs Soprano           15.00               .083       .249       -0.531
  Mezzo vs Soprano          22.00               .328       .985       -0.312
  * adjusted p < 0.05. U is for the first group of the pair; r is positive when that group ranks above the second.


  ── Adjusted p-values (Bonferroni) ──────────

              Alto        Mezzo       Soprano     
Alto          ---         1.000       .249        
Mezzo         1.000       ---         .985        
Soprano       .249        .985        ---         
  Symmetric: the p for A vs B is the p for B vs A.
  * adjusted p < 0.05


  ── Rank-biserial r (effect sizes) ──────────

              Alto        Mezzo       Soprano     
Alto          ---         -0.281      -0.531      
Mezzo         0.281       ---         -0.312      
Soprano       0.531       0.312       ---         
  Row minus column: a negative r means the ROW group ranks
  lower than the COLUMN group. |r| is the effect size.

  Conventions: quartiles R type 7 · SD & variance n-1
  · rank tests average tied ranks (tie-corrected).
══════════════════════════════════════════════
